<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Auckland still in talks, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>Auckland still in talks, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auckland Investments said on Wednesday, referring to earlier cautioneries, it was in talks which could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
